{"steam_appid":1051690,"steam_name":"Nightmare Reaper","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1051690/766725657/4c526193258a307b8edf12be58fc9befeb6cd4e4/1773712491/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773756875","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257304720/b36a01cbd9890c5a03b4c9a977ec034b828eae4a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773756875","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/ss_a01163484e272a8826c38977bdfb95c446feae2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773756876","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/ss_d414db7b7bacca915d76b48dd71bf22b61074997.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773756876","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/ss_d5ddcd486335bdb898384189aa49d63a53d71000.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773756876","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/ss_101ada406ba4e7c787590756134a78b6a47c5a74.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773756876","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/ss_212e777ed1d2bb5c92b7b9f422ab733115a4b57e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773756876"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/7c04aafc6010276db45deb9aac2d2201.avif?t=1773756876\" width=600 height=267 /></span><br><br>A dark and violent meld of retro and modern action games, inspired by the classic 2.5D first person shooters of the 90s, with elements of modern looter shooters and rogue-lites.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense and addictive gameplay</h2><br>Tons of enemies are crammed in open-ended levels full of surprises and geysers of blood and treasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/d60c99a141decc93de21ad6dc20dd792.poster.avif?t=1773756876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/d60c99a141decc93de21ad6dc20dd792.webm?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/d60c99a141decc93de21ad6dc20dd792.mp4?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character progression</h2><br>Use the gold you find to purchase tons of character upgrades and new abilities via minigames.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/83b0f7d820e8f2090a97ee51ed76ba43.poster.avif?t=1773756876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/83b0f7d820e8f2090a97ee51ed76ba43.webm?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/83b0f7d820e8f2090a97ee51ed76ba43.mp4?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ludicrous weapon variety</h2><br>80 unique weapons that can drop as loot and can contain a funky mix of over 30 enchantment types.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/ccbe413b3a34e63db801fa84db3a93c5.poster.avif?t=1773756876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/ccbe413b3a34e63db801fa84db3a93c5.webm?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1051690/extras/ccbe413b3a34e63db801fa84db3a93c5.mp4?t=1773756876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SO much more</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Music and audio by the great <strong>Andrew Hulshult</strong>.<br></li><li>Non-intrusive but mysterious story.<br></li><li>Many game modes.<br></li><li>A mix of manual and random level generation.<br></li><li>Tons of random events and secrets.</li></ul><br><i>You rise to prevent her doom<br>and duke it out with nightmares<br>to reap salvation in blood.</i>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 670<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A SSD is recommended</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["Blazing Bit Games"],"publishers":["Blazing Bit Games"],"release_date":"28 Mar, 2022"}